OL,3,GNEWSABarefoot fundraiser plans 24-hour
OL,4,Amountain challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Worcestershire is planning
OL,7,Fto climb up and down Yr Wyddfa
OL,8,F(Snowdon) as many times as possible in
OL,9,F24 hours, completely barefoot.
OL,11,FJosh Mantle, from Stourport, will begin
OL,12,Fthe challenge at 01:00 BST on 11
OL,13,FOctober and has described it as the
OL,14,F"hardest challenge of [his] life", but
OL,15,Fsays it is all in aid of KEMP Hospice.
OL,17,FThe 20-year-old said he was inspired by
OL,18,Fanother barefoot climber he met on
OL,19,FWales' tallest mountain, which "lit
OL,20,Fsomething inside" him.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
