OL,3,GNEWSABarefoot fundraiser plans 24-hour
OL,4,Amountain challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought that looks crazy," he said,
OL,7,Fadding, "and me being the crazy person
OL,8,Fthat I am, I thought I would give that
OL,9,Fa go."
